 "Compliance systems translate law and ethics into operating practice."}, {"id": "b16606ce-3bd2-4e9d-a04a-5baf1aa833ff", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Whistleblowing", "children": [{"id": "724097dc-2cfd-46fe-a186-8fe17c1c6606", "type": "concept", "title": "Reporting channels"}, {"id": "bbbee58a-254b-42f3-a2ee-5c95a628ee83", "type": "concept", "title": "Anti-retaliation"}, {"id": "6022b8ea-5505-4077-b5db-c98d0b6ec58d", "type": "concept", "title": "Incentives and protections"}], "description": "Speaking-up systems expose risks leaders may otherwise miss."}, {"id": "ef9f31b6-fcfc-411a-919c-2b953ad64096", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Internal investigations", "children": [{"id": "ecec2b88-c292-43c8-b73f-0fe42e7ef791", "type": "concept", "title": "Fact gathering"}, {"id": "35f363fd-4edd-4e1a-b116-2a1300952b83", "type": "concept", "title": "Privilege and confidentiality"}, {"id": "ded7b3a0-38c7-425e-997c-bbf18b1dd146", "type": "concept", "title": "Remediation and discipline"}], "description": "Organizations need fair, documented responses to suspected misconduct."}]}, {"id": "77007ff6-8628-4578-9201-01036809a09a", "type": "topic", "title": "Global Business Law, Cross-Cultural Ethics, and Anti-Corruption", "description": "Students examine business conduct across borders, legal systems, and cultural expectations.", "children": [{"id": "f1536df8-e3b2-471b-9b60-17f2edb21f2b", "type": "subtopic", "title": "International legal risk", "children": [{"id": "75831832-f3ea-4b22-88ba-31d6d11130db", "type": "concept", "title": "Choice of law"}, {"id": "f7b4ce96-d182-4199-8fe2-25aaf6fab6ef", "type": "concept", "title": "Trade compliance"}, {"id": "7cf2232c-e8f5-4cbe-acf7-fad55fa37290", "type": "concept", "title": "Sanctions and export controls preview"}], "description": "Cross-border business raises jurisdiction, enforcement, and treaty issues."}, {"id": "6b44a912-f20d-4ee7-977b-4c8fcd4c7a04", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Anti-corruption", "children": [{"id": "46f1f6be-30a4-47dd-8f87